store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807960/d7ae078e0a543a97ff5a5d72165999535b0b1cdc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772041184","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Chat Speech-to-text","id":72},{"description":"Chat Text-to-speech","id":73},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"HDR available","id":61}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>The Best Selling Shooter of 2025</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807960/extras/5bcf92dc732111e28490c993210223b4.avif?t=1772041184\" width=1560 height=390 /></span><br>Battlefield 6 has powered its way to critical acclaim, receiving a number of prestigious accolades including PC Gamer's Best FPS of the Year, GamesRadar+'s #1 FPS of the Year, and Shacknews' Best Multiplayer Game of 2025.</p><br><h1>Fight the fog of war in Season 2. Play now.</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807960/extras/3d842104da1f32e4cbc9a2a6bf217910.avif?t=1772041184\" width=1560 height=390 /></span><br>The war with Pax Armata crosses the globe and infiltrates the mountainsides of Germany in a grueling assault to reclaim a once-owned NATO airbase. Season 2 will be released in 3 parts: Extreme Measures, Nightfall, and Hunter/Prey, featuring high-intensity maps, critical gadgets, iconic new hardware, and vehicles for waging the ultimate all-out war experience. Season 2 later sees the limited-time mode Operation Augur, where the stakes are high and strategy is crucial \u2014 driving squads to get to the frontline and secure the win.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807960/extras/5ca02a9666650caa1803ffa355629285.avif?t=1772041184\" width=1560 height=1200 /></span></p><br><h1>Battlefield\u2122 6 Phantom Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807960/extras/b1b27eac3840352e07960bdaae319900.avif?t=1772041184\" width=700 height=890 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807960/extras/3ed25d0c35184eef36fb238e327ba9b8.avif?t=1772041184\" width=700 height=1100 /></span></p><br>Get the Battlefield\u2122 6 Phantom Edition** and receive:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Battlefield Pro Token</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The Phantom Pack, featuring:<br>\u200e<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Phantom Squad: 4 Soldier Skins<br></li><li>\u200e 2 Weapon Packages<br></li><li>\u200e Melee Knife Weapon Skin<br></li><li>Vehicle Skin<br></li><li>Weapon Sticker<br></li><li>\u200eWeapon Charm<br></li><li>\u200eDog Tag</li></ul></li><li>Phantom XP Boost Set</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>The ultimate all-out warfare experience. Fight in high-intensity infantry combat. Rip through the skies in aerial dogfights. Demolish your environment for a strategic advantage. Harness complete control over every action and movement using the Kinesthetic Combat System. In a war of tanks, fighter jets, and massive combat arsenals, the deadliest weapon is your squad. This is Battlefield 6.<br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807960/extras/df0c2b1667aecb3a2dd8a4e573dd55e2.poster.avif?t=1772041184\" width=610 height=1338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807960/extras/df0c2b1667aecb3a2dd8a4e573dd55e2.webm?t=1772041184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807960/extras/df0c2b1667aecb3a2dd8a4e573dd55e2.mp4?t=1772041184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807960/extras/a8e9f573d7ff8a083c04b1756b423b25.poster.avif?t=1772041184\" width=610 height=1362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807960/extras/a8e9f573d7ff8a083c04b1756b423b25.webm?t=1772041184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807960/extras/a8e9f573d7ff8a083c04b1756b423b25.mp4?t=1772041184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br>This game includes optional in-game purchases of virtual currency that can be used to acquire virtual in-game items.</li></ul>","developers":["Battlefield Studios"],"dlc":[4149410,4149400,4149440,3645440,4149480,3933070,3574360],"ext_user_account_notice":"EA Account linking required (Supports Linking to Steam Account)","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/